8. Security Requirements

- Secure password hashing.
- Secure session management.
- Backend authorization.
- CSRF protection.
- XSS protection.
- SQL injection protection.
- Rate limiting.
- Email verification.
- Session revocation.
- Upload validation.
- Security event logging.
- Admin step-up authentication.

Five failed password attempts must trigger a 15-minute lock.

During the lock, even a correct password must not bypass the lock.

